# TESTING

Every database change requires appropriate tests.

Validate:
- migration;
- rollback/recovery where applicable;
- PK/FK;
- UNIQUE;
- CHECK;
- NOT NULL;
- delete behavior;
- history;
- duplicate prevention;
- security scope;
- representative queries;
- concurrency;
- API compatibility.

Include negative tests for:
- unauthorized IDs;
- cross-school access;
- invalid relationships;
- duplicates;
- malicious/untrusted input.
